Horizon Car
===========

The car model, `low_poly_small_car.glb`, is by **scailman** and is licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC-BY-4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes made for this project: the model is transformed at build time into
flat-shaded quads for Minecraft rendering (scaled, split into a body and four
wheels, coplanar triangles merged, interior and hidden detail removed). The
original `.glb` file is kept unmodified in this repository.

